onducive to a traditional bra or that doesn't give you the kind of coverage that you're looking for.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (\uc2 ABC NEWS\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 (OC) Sure.\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (\uc2 ABC NEWS\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 (OC) These Cakes do the trick. They allow women to feel confident in any clothing, even, quite frankly, in swimsuit they work with.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (\uc2 ABC NEWS\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 (OC) Wow.\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (\uc2 ABC NEWS\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 (OC) So, we've got a big variety of both their adhesive and non-adhesive they call them grippy and sticky variety of skin tones as well.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (\uc2 ABC NEWS\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 (OC) Yes, that's, that's (inaudible).\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (\uc2 ABC NEWS\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 (OC) So, you can pick the perfect match for you. Protect sensitive areas at 50 percent off.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (\uc2 ABC NEWS\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 (OC) Great deal right there.\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (\uc2 ABC NEWS\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 (OC) Yes. Okay. LYS Beauty stands for love yourself.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (\uc2 ABC NEWS\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 (OC) I love that.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: LYS BEAUTY\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (\uc2 ABC NEWS\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 (OC) And this is a company that has long supported the pink agenda. Skincare infused makeup. Elayna is a big fan. We had the founder here. One of the best-selling products, and they're really known for their diverse shade range. This little one right here, a sculpting bronzer. Elayna and I were saying this morning that sculpting and contouring can take 5 pounds off your face.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (\uc2 ABC NEWS\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 (OC) Five pounds, all right.\par \par \uc2 TORY JOHNSON (\uc2 ABC NEWS\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 (OC) Yeah, so we're, you know, maybe a little exaggerating on the 5 pounds, but sculpting and bronzing does the trick, and these little sticks make it so easy to do.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN 